VALUES ('ps5-dualsense-controller-standard', 'Sony PS5 DualSense Wireless Controller - Brand New - Original, Haptic Feedback, Adaptive Triggers', 'gaming', 115000, 115000, 95000, 15, 0.30, '/assets/products/ps5-dualsense-controller-standard.webp', 'The Sony DualSense wireless controller revolutionizes gaming immersion with haptic feedback that simulates in-game textures, environments, and impacts — feel raindrops, gravel, and explosions through your palms. Adaptive triggers provide dynamic resistance that mimics drawing a bowstring or pressing a brake pedal. The built-in microphone array enables voice chat without a headset, while the Create button lets you capture and broadcast your finest gaming moments instantly. With USB-C charging, Bluetooth connectivity, and a refined ergonomic design with iconic two-tone color scheme, this is the gold standard of next-generation gamepads. Available in White, Midnight Black, Cosmic Red, Starlight Blue, Nova Pink, and Galactic Purple. Brand new, sealed in original Sony packaging.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 95000, '/assets/products/ps5-dualsense-controller-standard.webp', 105000, 4.8, 1, 'Sony', 1, 1, 'gadgets');

