VALUES ('ps5-dual-charging-dock', 'Sony PS5 Dual Charging Dock - Brand New - Original, Charges 2 Controllers Simultaneously', 'gaming', 48000, 48000, 38000, 12, 0.25, '/assets/products/ps5-dual-charging-dock.webp', 'Keep your battle station organized with the official Sony PS5 Dual Charging Dock. Designed to seamlessly match your PS5 aesthetic with the same white and black color scheme, this dock charges two DualSense wireless controllers simultaneously without connecting to the console. The click-in design ensures secure docking, while the intelligent charging indicators display charging status at a glance. Free up your console''s USB ports and ensure your controllers are always ready for your next gaming session. Compatible with both DualSense and DualSense Edge controllers. Brand new, sealed in original Sony packaging.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 38000, '/assets/products/ps5-dual-charging-dock.webp', 43000, 4.7, 0, 'Sony', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

