VALUES ('ps5-cooling-stand-charging', 'PS5 Cooling Stand with Dual Controller Charger - Brand New - Vertical Design, RGB LED', 'gaming', 48000, 48000, 38000, 10, 0.55, '/assets/products/ps5-cooling-stand-charging.webp', 'Maximize your PS5''s longevity and organization with this multifunctional cooling stand. Featuring high-velocity cooling fans that maintain optimal thermal performance during intensive gaming, dual controller charging docks, and dedicated storage slots for up to twelve game cases or discs, this stand transforms your setup into a command center. The vertical design saves shelf space while ensuring proper airflow, and the LED indicators add a premium aesthetic touch to your gaming environment. Compatible with both PS5 Disc and Digital Editions. Includes USB power cable. Brand new, sealed, premium third-party accessory tested for PS5 compatibility.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 38000, '/assets/products/ps5-cooling-stand-charging.webp', 43000, 4.4, 0, 'Generic', 0, 0, 'gadgets');

