VALUES ('ps5-pro-carry-bag', 'PS5 Pro Protective Carry Bag - Brand New - Custom Foam Interior, Water-Resistant, Shoulder Strap', 'gaming', 72000, 72000, 58000, 8, 1.20, '/assets/products/ps5-pro-carry-bag.webp', 'Transport your PlayStation 5 Pro with confidence using this premium carry bag. Featuring a custom-molded interior with shock-absorbing foam padding, dedicated compartments for the console, controllers, cables, and games, this bag ensures your investment travels safely. The water-resistant exterior, reinforced handles, and adjustable shoulder strap provide comfort and protection whether you''re heading to a friend''s house or a gaming tournament. Padded dividers prevent scratches and impacts during transit. The TSA-friendly design allows airport security screening without removing the console. Compatible with PS5 Pro, PS5 Disc, and Digital Editions. Brand new, sealed, premium third-party accessory.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 58000, '/assets/products/ps5-pro-carry-bag.webp', 65000, 4.5, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

-- PS5 Slim Carry Bag (ADD)
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('ps5-slim-carry-bag', 'PS5 Slim Protective Carry Bag - Brand New - Lightweight, Foam Padded, Travel Friendly', 'gaming', 52000, 52000, 42000, 10, 0.90, '/assets/products/ps5-slim-carry-bag.webp', 'Designed specifically for the compact PS5 Slim form factor, this carry bag offers tailored protection with a precision-cut foam interior. The lightweight yet durable construction features water-resistant material, padded controller compartments, and game storage pockets. Whether you''re a mobile gamer or simply need safe storage, this bag ensures your PS5 Slim arrives at its destination in pristine condition. The ergonomic handle and optional shoulder strap provide versatile carrying options. Compatible with PS5 Slim Digital and Disc Editions. Brand new, sealed, premium third-party accessory.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 42000, '/assets/products/ps5-slim-carry-bag.webp', 47000, 4.4, 0, 'Generic', 0, 1, 'gadgets');

-- PS5 Pro Disc Drive Add-On (ADD)
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('ps5-pro-disc-drive-addon', 'Sony PS5 Pro Disc Drive Add-On - Brand New - 4K UHD Blu-ray, Plug & Play, Official Sony', 'gaming', 235000, 235000, 210000, 6, 0.40, '/assets/products/ps5-pro-disc-drive-addon.webp', 'Expand your PS5 Digital Edition or PS5 Pro with the official Sony Disc Drive add-on. This modular 4K UHD Blu-ray drive attaches seamlessly to your console, enabling physical game disc playback, 4K movie watching, and backward compatibility with your existing PS4 and PS5 disc library. The plug-and-play installation requires no tools, and the drive matches your console''s aesthetic perfectly. For digital console owners who want the flexibility of physical media — including pre-owned game purchases and 4K Blu-ray movie collections — this is the essential upgrade. Brand new, sealed in original Sony packaging.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 210000, '/assets/products/ps5-pro-disc-drive-addon.webp', 220000, 4.7, 1, 'Sony', 1, 1, 'gadgets');

-- PS5 Pulse Elite Headset (ADD)
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('ps5-pulse-elite-headset', 'Sony PS5 Pulse Elite Wireless Headset - Brand New - Planar Magnetic Drivers, AI Noise Rejection, 30H Battery', 'gaming', 295000, 295000, 255000, 6, 0.35, '/assets/products/ps5-pulse-elite-headset.webp', 'The Pulse Elite wireless headset represents the apex of PlayStation audio engineering. Featuring planar magnetic drivers that deliver audiophile-grade sound reproduction, AI-enhanced noise rejection for crystal-clear voice chat, and a retractable boom microphone, this headset brings studio quality to your gaming sessions. The wireless connection via the PlayStation Link USB adapter ensures lossless, ultra-low-latency audio with zero perceptible delay. With up to 30 hours of battery life, quick charging (10 minutes = 2 hours), and premium materials including plush leatherette ear cushions, this is the headset for discerning gamers who hear every detail — from enemy footsteps to orchestral scores. Compatible with PS5, PC, Mac, and PlayStation Portal. Brand new, sealed in original Sony packaging.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 255000, '/assets/products/ps5-pulse-elite-headset.webp', 275000, 4.8, 1, 'Sony', 1, 1, 'gadgets');

-- PS4 DualShock 4 Controller (ADD)
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('ps4-dualshock-4-controller', 'Sony PS4 DualShock 4 Wireless Controller - Original - Precision Control, Touchpad, Light Bar', 'gaming', 95000, 95000, 78000, 10, 0.22, '/assets/products/ps4-dualshock-4-controller.webp', 'The iconic Sony DualShock 4 wireless controller defined a generation of PlayStation gaming. Featuring precision analog sticks, a responsive touchpad, built-in mono speaker, 3.5mm headset jack, and the revolutionary Share button, this controller remains essential for PS4 gaming and is fully compatible with PS5 for backward-compatible PS4 titles. The integrated light bar changes color based on in-game events, while the Sixaxis motion sensing adds intuitive control. The ergonomic design with textured grips provides comfort during marathon sessions. Available in Jet Black. Original Sony product — tested, clean exterior, all buttons and sensors operational.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 78000, '/assets/products/ps4-dualshock-4-controller.webp', 86000, 4.6, 0, 'Sony', 0, 0, 'gadgets');

-- PS4 Generic X Controller (ADD)
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('ps4-generic-x-controller', 'PS4 Compatible Wireless Controller - X Design - Vibration Feedback, USB Charging', 'gaming', 22000, 22000, 17000, 15, 0.22, '/assets/products/ps4-generic-x-controller.webp', 'A budget-friendly alternative for PS4 gamers seeking a functional backup or secondary controller. This third-party gamepad features standard dual analog sticks, directional pad, action buttons, and shoulder triggers with wired USB connectivity. While lacking the advanced features of the DualShock 4, it provides reliable control for casual gaming, local multiplayer sessions, and younger players. Compatible with PS4, PC, and select Android devices via USB. Features dual vibration motors for immersive feedback. Brand new, sealed, third-party accessory.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 17000, '/assets/products/ps4-generic-x-controller.webp', 19500, 4.0, 0, 'Generic', 0, 0, 'gadgets');

-- PS4 Generic Controller Basic (ADD)
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('ps4-generic-controller-basic', 'PS4 Compatible Wired Controller - Basic - USB Connection, Standard Layout', 'gaming', 18000, 18000, 14000, 20, 0.20, '/assets/products/ps4-generic-controller-basic.webp', 'The most accessible entry point for PS4 controller needs. This generic wired controller offers standard PlayStation button layout, vibration feedback, and USB connectivity for reliable plug-and-play gaming. Ideal for local co-op sessions, children, or as an emergency backup when your primary controller needs charging. Compatible with PS4 and PC platforms. The lightweight design makes it comfortable for younger players. Brand new, sealed, third-party accessory.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 14000, '/assets/products/ps4-generic-controller-basic.webp', 16000, 3.9, 0, 'Generic', 0, 0, 'gadgets');

-- MEETION Gaming Headset (ADD)
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, category, basePrice, price, wholesalePrice, stock, weightKg, image, description, active, createdAt, wholesale_available, wholesale_price, image_url, reseller_price, rating, featured, brand, is_bestseller, is_new, store_type)
VALUES ('meetion-gaming-headset-2', 'MEETION Professional Gaming Headset - Brand New - 7.1 Surround Sound, 50mm Drivers, RGB LED', 'gaming', 105000, 105000, 88000, 12, 0.35, '/assets/products/meetion-gaming-headset-2.webp', 'The MEETION Professional Gaming Headset delivers immersive audio performance for competitive and casual gamers alike. Featuring precision-tuned 50mm neodymium drivers, virtual 7.1 surround sound, and a noise-canceling flexible microphone, this headset ensures you hear every footstep and communicate with crystal clarity. The ergonomic over-ear design with breathable protein leather ear cushions and adjustable headband provides marathon comfort during extended gaming sessions. With universal 3.5mm connectivity, RGB lighting accents, and inline volume control, this headset is compatible with PS5, PS4, Xbox, Nintendo Switch, PC, and mobile devices. The braided cable resists tangling and wear. Brand new, sealed, premium third-party accessory.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 88000, '/assets/products/meetion-gaming-headset-2.webp', 96000, 4.4, 0, 'MEETION', 0, 1, 'gadgets');
